  "description": "Chatham-3 equipped with a three-speed internal rear hub, which means all of the fragile parts are protected from muck, dirt, and grime. This bike comes standard with a hand-built, sturdy, steel frame for the utmost durability. An extra-wide cruiser saddle supports you while high handlebars with cushy grips encourage an upright riding position, taking the pressure off your back. Thick Wanda tires provide better grip and traction on the road.\n\nThis cruiser is equipped with a three-speed internal rear hub, which means all of the fragile parts are protected from muck, dirt, and grime. This mechanism is notorious for its precision, timeliness, and ease of use.\nThe handlebar-integrated grip-twist shifter makes switching gears easy and safe, never requiring you to remove your hands from the grips. As easy as we’ve made going forward, we’ve also simplified stopping. All you need to do is gently pedal backward to enable the coaster brake.\n\n*Due to differences in screen resolutions, please note that colors may differ slightly.",
